              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each machine has a two or three man crew armed with swords. Bolt Thrower - see WAB rulebook: range 36", Strength 4/-1 per rank, no save, D3 wounds per hit. Looted artillery: one looted piece per 2,000 points (Early Revolt), per 1,000 points (Late Revolt); none in the Germano-Gallic army. (Spartacus p.14)</characteristic>
